The current roadmap can display individual movements as 0/3 even though the main workout counter correctly shows completed sets.

This is a significant state-management bug.

All completion indicators must derive from the same authoritative set records.

Examples:

- 1 completed set out of 3 → 1/3.
- 2 completed sets out of 3 → 2/3.
- All sets completed → 3/3 and Completed.
